To run the case:

wmake all relevant source code into OpenFOAM

Go into presentedAerofoilCase
Run the following commands:

hexahedralMeshGenerator symmetricAirfoil
topoSet
createPatch -overwrite

This is how to create a mesh in OpenFOAM

Running the simulation:

cp -r 0.steadyState/ 0
./runMeshMovement
